infinite-patch 1
# Trautonium Subharmonic Formant Bow Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.5
  i steps 16
  i note0 45
  i note1 52
  i note2 48
  i note3 57
